A||N||3||Bob Englert||Genuine GM Parts Source||||1||
Z||000000||Bob Englert||12-22-2000||09:38 PM||||I wanted to share a web site where you can order genuine GM parts at an excellent discount.  You will need to know the p/n since they don't list cars older than 1992.  If you have access to a 22P book it is an excellent resource.<P>The site is <A HREF="http://www.gmpartsdirect.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.gmpartsdirect.com</A> <P>For example, I just ordered a NEW trunk weatherstrip seal for my 87 GT for $62.88.  A EGR soleniod that I could only find locally for almost $90 was available for $59.  OEM EGR tube for the 87 was about $60.<P>The shipping and handling charges can be high for small items, but it is a good resource to compare, particularly when you are looking for GM parts.<P>Hope it is helpful for you!<P>Happy holidays...<P>------------------<BR>Bob<BR>2 - 87 GT's<BR>85 SE 4 cyl||||reg||1
Z||000001||rockcrawl||12-22-2000||11:58 PM||||I've known about that site for a while. Their prices can't be beaten. How 'bout GT quarter windows for about $127 each! I've never ordered from them, but I've heard the shipping times can be pretty bad. I'm going to order my outer window weatherstrips from them.<P>------------------<BR>Jon Lagler<BR>'87 GT<BR>4.9 liter V8 Testarossa Spyder (under construction)<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/rockcrawlsig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||theogre||12-23-2000||12:35 PM||||There is a dealer with parts online as well. <BR> <A HREF="http://www.lustine.com" TARGET=_blank>www.lustine.com</A> <P>I haven't dealt with them. I use the site mainly to check prices and verify part numbers. I hadn't payed any attention to shipping.<P>You can also find allot of GM/ACDelco parts on Wrenchead.com. Sometimes in places you would not expect.... Like did you know there is no bypass valve in Fiero oil filters. That's because it is in the block and you can actually order the thing from wrenchead. It's listed with the oil filters and it cost about $3.||||reg||1
Z||000003||terryk||12-24-2000||01:49 AM||||I priced the Getrag shift cables there.<P><BR>10054258 CABLE   $248.00  $186.00  $148.80  <BR>10066448 CABLE   $280.60  $210.45  $168.36  <P>Choke......||||reg||1
